      <p>DNSRecord is a DNS record managed in the zones defined by dns.config.openshift.io/cluster .spec.publicZone and .spec.privateZone.</p>
      <p>Cluster admin manipulation of this resource is not supported. This resource is only for internal communication of OpenShift operators.</p>
      <p>If DNSManagementPolicy is "Unmanaged", the operator will not be responsible for managing the DNS records on the cloud provider.</p>
      <p>Compatibility level 1: Stable within a major release for a minimum of 12 months or 3 minor releases (whichever is longer).</p>
      </dd>
