      <TableCell><code>recordTTL</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>recordTTL is the record TTL in seconds. If zero, the default is 30. RecordTTL will not be used in AWS regions Alias targets, but will be used in CNAME targets, per AWS API contract.</TableCell>
